Sword Emblem was added in '''Beta 39.1''' as a 6G 4/4 with Taunt, Armor (1) and Thorns (1). Its first change was already in '''Beta 40.0''', where it, alongside +1 cost, lost both Taunt and Thorns and gained a Magic instead. If played on the left, it would regain Taunt, making it a +2/+2/+2 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Receptionist_2 Receptionist 2] with -1 Armor. If played on the right, it would instead gain Haste. This makes it more similar to [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Mister_Society Mister Society].

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP: 4

Cost:
* 6 (Post Beta 39.1)
* 7 (Post Beta 40.0, Current)
Abilities:
* Armor (1). Taunt. Thorns (1). (Post Beta 39.1)
* Armor (1). Magic: If played left, gain Taunt. If played right, gain Haste. (Post Beta 40.0, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)
